{"1837693281519464449":{"a":"<p>So, like, why is the FAA in charge of commercial spacecraft at all? Government spacecraft are handled by NASA and other agencies, no? How is the FAA qualified to regulate space at all? It&#x27;s nothing like aircraft. It just happens to pass through the air for a couple minutes.</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1837693281519464449</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1837693281519464449\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-09-22T03:19:55Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1837700397865005320":{"a":"<p>This whole site would be an ion bridge. You should also find Marx generators nearby. Remember, it can do many things at once. Don&#x27;t get hung up on it being used for X and therefore can&#x27;t be Y. These exist in many forms everywhere. Look around from above.<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KRVvzjm24Zc\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/KRVvzjm24Zc?enablejsapi=1\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KRVvzjm24Zc\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1828386251629559895\">https://x.com/i/status/1828386251629559895</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1837700397865005320</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1837700397865005320\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-09-22T03:48:12Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>6</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>16</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>1828156685036191823</dd>\n</dl>"},"1837702574213869818":{"a":"<p>What&#x27;s an ion bridge? A network of radiators which directly couple high voltage, low frequency (RF at audio frequencies) into the ionosphere. If you could see the ion stream you&#x27;d see what&#x27;s called a catastrophe beam linked directly into the sky. At high enough power it can glow. t.co</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GYDUwERXIAAy_gZ.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GYDUwFJWQAAOxin.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GYDUwIEWMAArWlG.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GYDUwLjWMAAPvC6.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1837700397865005320\">https://x.com/i/status/1837700397865005320</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1837702574213869818</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1837702574213869818\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-09-22T03:56:51Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>7</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>16</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>1828156685036191823</dd>\n</dl>"},"1837703315510988883":{"a":"<p>This effectively makes the entire sky the antenna. If you take advantage of harmonics vast amounts of information can be transmitted. Look for antennas at harmonic wavelengths from this site. You&#x27;d see a dome like structure if you could see the ion beams.<br>\n<a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ionosphere\">en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ionosphere</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1837702574213869818\">https://x.com/i/status/1837702574213869818</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1837703315510988883</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1837703315510988883\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-09-22T03:59:47Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>8</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>16</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>1828156685036191823</dd>\n</dl>"},"1837704289080189241":{"a":"<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1799577205741166794\">Tweet by @DavidLNorris</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1799577205741166794\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1799577205741166794</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1837703315510988883\">https://x.com/i/status/1837703315510988883</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1837704289080189241</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1837704289080189241\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-09-22T04:03:40Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>zxx</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>9</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>16</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>1828156685036191823</dd>\n</dl>"},"1837704368545554748":{"a":"<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1816537431564320867\">Tweet by @DavidLNorris</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1816537431564320867\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1816537431564320867</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1837704289080189241\">https://x.com/i/statu